ent</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH with tubing hanger to working height. Mounted penetrator in TH, measured cable cutting point. Disassembled penetrator and spaced out for cable splice. Performed final electrical checks on cable. Removed banana sheave from PRS.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-08T08:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-08T15:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">792</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>completion -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cut cable and spooled back remaining cable to reel. Spliced cable to penetrator pigtails.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-08T15:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-08T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">795</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>completion -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed penetrator in hanger, installed clamps on cable. Pressure tested penetrator seals, 69 bar / 10 min. Tested downhole system after splicing - ok.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-08T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-08T16:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">795</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>completion -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed Vetco O-ring for tubing hanger. Removed master bushings.</witsml